ore of a I've got way too much crap going on to borrow more drama kinda deal. But, there are people I really, really miss from here, people I do think of a lot even if I haven't talked to them in a year. So quick update. Nothing's really changed that much. Still married, still stuff bears for a living, still have no kids. I did adopt a new dog this year though, so I now have two crazy hellhounds, one tiny and female, instead of just the male crazy. This past year at work has been so completely insane and obnoxious that I cannot go into it. But it has taught me to roll with crap for my own sanity. And that I think my resume is only visible to people that I would never ever want to work for. These are my lessons from 2013. I can't promise that I'll be poking my head in much. Especially if the panicky feeling doesn't go away. But I talk to Dem a bunch, so he'll pass things onto me and if any of you want a way to reach me outside of here, let me know. I'd love to hear from you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1285-xaria","name":"Xaria","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T19:26:45-08:00","id":16421,"title":"","content":"Hey, Xee. We've missed you too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T19:43:12-08:00","id":16429,"title":"","conte